// # LSP Scripts Index - Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the 4 build entry points. They exec OODA_COMPILER. They do not print fake success.
//
// Setup: Each script has a single purpose. They compose: build -> test -> verify -> release checks.
//
// Beats:
//   1. build.oo - typecheck lsp/cli/main.oo.
//   2. test.oo - run all 8 probe drivers in qa/.
//   3. verify.oo - ANCHOR presence, 256-line cap, no VERSION file.
//   4. release.oo - build + test + verify. Git tag is auto-release on push.

import "build.oo";
import "test.oo";
import "verify.oo";
import "release.oo";
